\]
No sovereign system may exhibit runaway divergence.

\subsection{Axiom II: Convergence}

Perceptual output $Y(t)$ must satisfy:
\[
\lim_{t\to\infty} Y(t) = Y_{\infty}.
\]
No sovereign system may produce unbounded perceptual drift.

\subsection{Axiom III: Cryptographic Immutability}

Every cognitive epoch $k$ must produce:
\[
\Lambda(k) = \mathrm{SHA256}(X_k, U_k, Y_k, \Phi_{B,k}, \Phi_{C,k}, \Lambda(k-1)).
