Sovereign intelligence is domain-independent.

\subsection{Axiom V: Predictive Accountability}

Predicted states must satisfy:
\[
\|\hat{S}(t+1) - S(t+1)\| \leq \rho \|\hat{S}(t) - S(t)\|,
